Your fury becomes an unseen force that randomly lashes out at foes around you. For [6, 7, 8, 9, 10 (TL1-5)] turns you strike [1, 1, 1, 2, 2 (TL1-5)] ([25%, 66%, 99%, 26%, 50% (TL1-5)] chance for [2, 2, 2, 3, 3 (TL1-5)]) nearby target(s) within range 5 doing [83, 112, 134, 153, 170 (TL1-5; MP 100)] damage and 2 knockback. The number of extra strikes increases at higher talent levels.

In addition, your ability to channel force with this talent increases all critical damage by [4%, 7%, 10%, 12%, 15% (TL1-5)] (currently: 0%)

Damage increases with your Mindpower.
